# edge-to-edge: the top bar extends under the status bar, content starts below it;
# predictive back: progress shifts the screen, cancel restores it, release pops it
@size 390x844
insets 44 34
why "Vard native"
tap "Settings"
expect "Settings"
back 0.5
why "Dark mode"
back cancel
back
expect "Vard native"
expect no "Dark mode"
back
keyboard 300
why "App launches: 1"
